00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:41.480 line:20%
FAIR AND JUST, LOYAL AND TRUE

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:02.320 line:100%
YUXI CIGARETTE

00:02:07.680 --> 00:02:09.439 line:100%
Stop looking.

00:02:10.320 --> 00:02:11.720 line:100%
He is not coming.

00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:13.640 line:100%
You should just come with me
to the cement factory.

00:02:13.720 --> 00:02:15.200 line:100%
Let's wait a bit longer.

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:16.920 line:100%
He told the property management
on the phone

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:17.840 line:100%
that he would come in person.

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:22.840 line:100%
Trying to deal with someone like
Song Qingsong, you are still too green.

00:02:23.360 --> 00:02:25.480 line:100%
Just this bag of stuff.

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:27.240 line:100%
It means nothing to him.

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:30.800 line:100%
-Why would he come?
-What if he feels guilty?

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:33.040 line:100%
What if there's something at home
he doesn't want anyone

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:34.360 line:100%
or the police to find?

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.400 line:100%
I think the one feeling guilty is you.

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:43.960 line:100%
Keep staring, and you will turn
into Meng Jiangnv.

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:53.360 line:100%
QINGSONG CEMENT FACTORY, WEIYANG CITY

00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:06.160 line:100%
What are you doing?

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:09.240 line:100%
That guy dared to harm Wolf.
I am going to cripple him.

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:11.200 line:100%
Do you even have a brain?

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:12.800 line:100%
Did you forget we have transformed?

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:15.080 line:100%
Still talking about knives and guns?
Put it away.

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:17.760 line:100%
Mr. Jin, you said it yourself,
we were going to deal with him.

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:21.560 line:100%
Do you know who owns that car
with plate 688?

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:23.920 line:100%
The boss of Qingsong Cement Factory,

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.440 line:100%
Song Qingsong.

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:27.960 line:100%
How many lives do you think
you have to mess with him?

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:30.120 line:100%
So we are not avenging Wolf?

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:33.080 line:100%
We need to figure out the situation first
before we take revenge.

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:36.640 line:100%
How did Song Qingsong
get involved with Manlang?

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:37.920 line:100%
Alright.

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:39.880 line:100%
That makes sense.

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:51.320 line:100%
Follow him.

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:57.000 line:100%
QINGSONG CEMENT FACTORY, WEIYANG CITY

00:04:16.639 --> 00:04:19.319 line:100%
If any words Song Qingsong said were true,

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:23.680 line:100%
every pig in Weiyang
would be climbing trees.

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:17.480 line:100%
Criminal Department.

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:18.880 line:100%
<i>A Mercedes just arrived at the entrance.</i>

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:20.400 line:100%
<i>They say they are</i>
<i>the owner from Yuanlongli.</i>

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:24.520 line:100%
Let them in.

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:27.200 line:100%
-Brigade meeting room.
-<i>Got it.</i>

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:36.280 line:100%
Come on. We'll be seeing pigs climb trees.

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:42.840 line:100%
Hey.

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:44.920 line:100%
Why the rush?

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:47.360 line:100%
Have you figured out
how to question him about Xu Meng?

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:49.040 line:100%
Go through every detail
and verify everything.

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:51.800 line:100%
As long as there are inconsistencies,
we will find a breakthrough.

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:55.920 line:100%
Song Qingsong
is the victim, not a suspect.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:58.640 line:100%
What if he just takes his stuff
and leaves without saying anything?

00:05:58.720 --> 00:06:00.520 line:100%
Tell me, what will you do then?

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:08.120 line:100%
So what is your plan?

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:18.880 line:100%
Very simple. Five words.

00:06:19.840 --> 00:06:21.280 line:100%
We will work in tandem.

00:06:23.600 --> 00:06:24.640 line:100%
How?

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:26.800 line:100%
I lead, you back me up.

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:28.880 line:100%
I ease him in, you pin him down.

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:30.960 line:100%
I play the good cop, you play the bad cop.

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:31.880 line:100%
Got it?

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:35.480 line:100%
Are you sure
that's really your real intention?

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:39.080 line:100%
Just tell me. Do you get it or not?

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:43.960 line:100%
SPECIAL TASK FORCE

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:44.880 line:100%
The good cop goes first.

00:06:53.560 --> 00:06:57.280 line:100%
What is Song Qingsong
doing at the police station?

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:00.440 line:100%
Could the police have traced
the Wolf case back to him?

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.080 line:100%
Trace, my foot.

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:03.600 line:100%
If they had, he'd be here in a police car.

00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:04.680 line:100%
Right.

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:08.320 line:100%
You just reminded me.

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:11.880 line:100%
If Song Qingsong
really had dealings with Manlang,

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:14.760 line:100%
-then we could…
-We can squeeze him for a big payout.

00:07:14.840 --> 00:07:16.000 line:100%
Squeeze your head.

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:18.680 line:100%
Jeez. We need to think differently.

00:07:18.760 --> 00:07:22.400 line:100%
Use this opportunity
to talk to Song Qingsong.

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:24.520 line:100%
Get him to throw us some business.

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:29.000 line:100%
That's called "Water flows downhill,
people move up."

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:30.600 line:100%
Move up?

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:33.400 line:100%
What Song Qingsong did before
was way worse than what we did.

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:34.400 line:100%
I…

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:36.960 line:100%
If someone like him can clean up his act,

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:40.600 line:100%
then I should learn from him.

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:53.320 line:100%
ID and letter of introduction are fine.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:59.480 line:100%
This tea tastes terrible.

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:03.560 line:100%
Wait.

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:05.680 line:100%
The owner has to come in person
to claim the stolen items.

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:06.960 line:100%
Call Song Qingsong.

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:08.440 line:100%
Have him come himself.

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:11.840 line:100%
Officer,
I have already made it very clear.

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:15.440 line:100%
The house belongs to my brother-in-law,
but I have been living there recently.

00:08:15.520 --> 00:08:18.200 line:100%
So everything in the safe belongs to me.

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:22.280 line:100%
Alright. Let's verify everything,
one by one.

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:23.960 line:100%
What do you mean?

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:25.560 line:100%
Where were you earlier?

00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:29.160 line:100%
By procedure, we need to confirm
in person that the items are yours

00:08:29.760 --> 00:08:30.840 line:100%
before you can take them.

00:08:34.839 --> 00:08:35.880 line:100%
Please go ahead.

00:08:41.959 --> 00:08:43.920 line:100%
What brand is the liquor?
How many bottles?

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:46.840 line:20%
Moutai. 53-degree Feitian.

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:47.920 line:100%
-Four bottles.
-Cigarettes?

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:49.040 line:100%
Zhonghua. Four cartons.

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:50.880 line:100%
Four cartons of Zhonghua.

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:55.680 line:100%
-Yuxi.
-Two cartons.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:59.360 line:100%
Two cartons of Yuxi.

00:08:59.440 --> 00:09:00.760 line:100%
Flip-top Yuxi.

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:06.200 line:100%
Belts?

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:08.120 line:100%
Two belts.

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:09.840 line:100%
One gold Rolex.

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:11.480 line:100%
Three gold rings.

00:09:11.560 --> 00:09:12.920 line:100%
Five gold chains.

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:14.280 line:100%
Two lighters.

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:15.600 line:100%
Three bundles of cash.

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:16.840 line:100%
Bring everything out.

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:19.040 line:100%
How much cash?

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:25.560 line:100%
Hundred-yuan bills.
Three bundles. Ten thousand each.

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:27.880 line:100%
That makes 30,000.

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:34.240 line:100%
He.

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:37.120 line:100%
That number sounds familiar.

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:39.240 line:100%
Yeah, it does.

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:41.040 line:100%
I heard there's a rule on the street.

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:45.120 line:100%
Say it's a 40,000-yuan job,
you pay 10,000 upfront,

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:48.280 line:100%
then the remaining 30 after it's done.

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:50.040 line:100%
And there's usually a little bonus, right?

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:52.440 line:100%
At least

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:55.120 line:100%
two cartons of flip-top Yuxi.

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:04.360 line:100%
Keep going.

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:06.360 line:100%
I don't have all day.

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:07.880 line:100%
Have you checked everything?

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:08.840 line:100%
Can I go now?

00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:13.560 line:100%
Darn it.

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:29.880 line:100%
My watch… Where is my gold Rolex?
Where is the money?

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:31.800 line:100%
-Where is my briefcase?
-What briefcase?

00:10:34.720 --> 00:10:36.240 line:100%
Briefcase… There is no briefcase.

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:37.480 line:100%
You remembered it wrong.

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:38.640 line:100%
I am a bit confused.

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:41.000 line:100%
I have been here too long.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:49.200 line:100%
You mean Song Qingsong's briefcase?

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:50.640 line:100%
No, no. I remembered it wrong.
There wasn't one.

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:53.840 line:100%
It had "Qingsong Cement"
written on it, right?

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:54.960 line:100%
I remembered it wrong.

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:56.120 line:100%
Something in that bag you don't want seen?

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:59.840 line:100%
Call Song Qingsong.
Tell him the briefcase is missing.

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:06.240 line:100%
<i>Take the items.</i>

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:07.520 line:100%
<i>Get to Dahuihuang now.</i>

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:12.440 line:100%
I still have work.
Is it done now? Can I leave?

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:15.960 line:100%
Are you sure that's everything?
Nothing else? A watch?

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:17.520 line:100%
-Cash?
-I am sure.

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:19.800 line:100%
That is all.

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:42.560 line:100%
"Build strength."

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:44.480 line:100%
What is that?

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:46.760 line:100%
"Forge the police…"

00:11:46.840 --> 00:11:48.120 line:100%
What is that?

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:53.680 line:100%
"Build strength, forge the police soul."

00:11:57.600 --> 00:11:58.840 line:100%
You don't recognize the "soul" character?

00:11:58.920 --> 00:12:00.520 line:100%
What does it mean?

00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:03.360 line:100%
Those two characters look a bit creepy.

00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:07.200 line:100%
It has two meanings.

00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:11.600 line:100%
One is ghost, the other is spirit.

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:13.160 line:100%
-Got it?
-Got it.

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:14.840 line:100%
I have plenty of spirit.

00:12:16.280 --> 00:12:17.480 line:100%
Whose kid are you?

00:12:17.560 --> 00:12:19.960 line:100%
My dad is He Yuanhang.

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:23.080 line:100%
That Officer He on secondment.
I have heard of him.

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:25.080 line:100%
Miss, I need to use the restroom.

00:12:25.160 --> 00:12:26.520 line:100%
Do you know where it is?

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:28.320 line:100%
Yes. I will take you.

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:31.040 line:100%
Let's go.

00:12:35.200 --> 00:12:36.160 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:39.400 line:100%
Your shoelace is undone. Let me tie it.

00:12:45.720 --> 00:12:46.800 line:100%
Miss, he is looking at your waist.

00:12:48.520 --> 00:12:50.360 line:100%
-Don't go. You're a bad guy.
-Hey.

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:52.040 line:100%
Kid, you're mistaken.

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:55.720 line:100%
-Mistaken? Kids don't lie.
-Dad, there's a pervert here!

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:57.760 line:100%
-What have you done?
-What is going on?

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:03.240 line:100%
Let go. Is this your child?

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:05.400 line:100%
None of your business.
Sharp face. Dark circles.

00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:08.000 line:100%
You look kind of creepy.

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:09.200 line:100%
Like a pervert.

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:13.840 line:100%
At such a young age,
your temper is already this bad.

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:15.640 line:100%
You'd better watch yourself
when you grow up.

00:13:16.240 --> 00:13:17.880 line:100%
-Hey!
-I am just telling the truth.

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:19.680 line:100%
You do need to be careful out there.

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:27.320 line:100%
He,

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:30.440 line:100%
when we mentioned the briefcase,
his eyes went right.

00:13:30.520 --> 00:13:32.600 line:100%
When we mentioned the cash,
they shifted left.

00:13:33.280 --> 00:13:35.720 line:100%
He was lying about the briefcase,

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:37.960 line:100%
but the 30,000 in cash,
he was recalling it.

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:42.120 line:100%
The one who hired someone
is very likely him.

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:46.320 line:100%
He should be on his way now
to find Song Qingsong.

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:48.400 line:100%
Song Qingsong.

00:13:49.520 --> 00:13:50.640 line:100%
Officer He,

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:54.080 line:100%
if you're going out, leave Xiaohe with me.

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:55.640 line:100%
I'm Liang Juan from the Analysis Unit.

00:13:55.720 --> 00:13:58.280 line:100%
I'm on the night shift. I can take her
to the cafeteria later.

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:06.720 line:100%
Thank you, Officer Liang.

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:08.080 line:100%
-Not at all.
-Kiddo,

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:09.640 line:100%
I'll come back to pick you up later.

00:14:09.720 --> 00:14:11.680 line:100%
-Listen to Ms. Liang, alright?
-Okay.

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:16.840 line:100%
So you are the new top graduate
in the Criminal Department.

00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:18.720 line:100%
He is.

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:20.640 line:100%
Hello.

00:14:20.720 --> 00:14:22.680 line:100%
You two work well together.

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:24.480 line:100%
Right, Xiaohe?

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:27.960 line:100%
Let's go.

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:30.480 line:100%
He's out.

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:34.600 line:100%
Wait.

00:14:36.360 --> 00:14:37.600 line:100%
He Yuanhang.

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:41.400 line:100%
The cops are following him.
Should we still follow?

00:14:42.120 --> 00:14:43.160 line:100%
Yes.

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:18.280 line:100%
He, just the Yuxi cigarettes
and Wu Shanlong's reactions aren't enough.

00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:20.520 line:100%
Even if we follow him
and find Song Qingsong,

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:22.320 line:100%
we need a plan first.

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.080 line:100%
What plan?

00:15:24.160 --> 00:15:25.520 line:100%
Get him back to the station first,
no matter what.

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:30.920 line:100%
What? Even a top graduate like you
consults me now?

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:38.080 line:100%
I have noticed your methods
can be quite effective at times.

00:15:38.800 --> 00:15:40.240 line:100%
There are only three days left.

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:41.680 line:100%
If we don't use some tactics,
we won't get anywhere.

00:15:41.760 --> 00:15:43.760 line:100%
This missing persons case looks simple,

00:15:44.280 --> 00:15:45.480 line:100%
but the deeper we dig,
the more complicated it gets.

00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:47.080 line:100%
It is like a maze.

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:49.160 line:100%
A maze?

00:15:50.440 --> 00:15:54.120 line:100%
I do have a theory for that.
Trémaux's algorithm.

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:56.400 line:100%
Don't even start. My head is spinning.

00:16:12.480 --> 00:16:13.800 line:100%
Is it funny?

00:16:20.800 --> 00:16:23.120 line:100%
Come on. You sing. Go on. Just sing.

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:24.280 line:100%
Come on, sing it!

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:25.920 line:100%
Sing.

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:35.280 line:100%
-Director Li.
-<i>Song Qingsong.</i>

00:16:35.360 --> 00:16:36.760 line:100%
What's your order?

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:38.720 line:100%
<i>Where are you?</i>

00:16:39.240 --> 00:16:41.280 line:100%
-At the factory.
-<i>At the factory?</i>

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:43.680 line:100%
<i>Do you know about the mine break-in?</i>

00:16:43.760 --> 00:16:44.600 line:100%
No.

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:50.760 line:100%
Well, I just got back
from a business trip.

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:55.760 line:100%
Are the documents still there?

00:16:55.840 --> 00:16:57.960 line:100%
<i>Still there? They have all been taken.</i>

00:16:58.040 --> 00:16:59.640 line:100%
<i>The police are involved now.</i>

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:01.760 line:100%
<i>I've been told to issue a statement</i>
<i>declaring all the stolen documents</i>

00:17:01.840 --> 00:17:02.920 line:100%
<i>null and void.</i>

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:04.119 line:100%
<i>Yours too.</i>

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:07.879 line:100%
Director Li, the documents may be voided,

00:17:08.399 --> 00:17:10.520 line:100%
but my money isn't, right?

00:17:10.600 --> 00:17:12.240 line:100%
<i>Are you out of your mind?</i>

00:17:12.320 --> 00:17:13.560 line:100%
<i>Talking about this on the phone?</i>

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:16.680 line:100%
Was the mine really robbed?

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:18.560 line:100%
-Or was it…
-<i>Enough.</i>

00:17:18.639 --> 00:17:21.800 line:100%
<i>Cut the crap. Burn the documents now.</i>

00:17:21.879 --> 00:17:24.240 line:100%
<i>If anyone sees them, it's on you.</i>

00:17:24.760 --> 00:17:25.919 line:100%
<i>Do you hear me?</i>

00:17:26.840 --> 00:17:27.680 line:100%
<i>Hello?</i>

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:29.080 line:100%
-Again.
-<i>Song Qingsong.</i>

00:17:29.760 --> 00:17:30.880 line:100%
-Another one.
-<i>Do you hear me?</i>

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:32.400 line:100%
Trying to set me up.

00:17:39.720 --> 00:17:42.040 line:100%
Mr. Liu, where are you now?

00:17:42.880 --> 00:17:44.520 line:100%
Here's the situation.

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:47.160 line:100%
Something just came up on my end.

00:17:47.240 --> 00:17:50.120 line:100%
My driver lost the documents.

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:53.400 line:100%
When you arrive, we'll talk…

00:17:54.320 --> 00:17:55.520 line:100%
Liu?

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:57.240 line:100%
Hello?

00:17:58.360 --> 00:17:59.600 line:100%
Hello?

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:15.120 line:100%
DAHUIHUANG NIGHTCLUB

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:40.560 line:100%
That fool Song Qingsong is not in the car.

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:43.440 line:100%
Then who is this idiot?

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:53.680 line:100%
Welcome, boss.
We are glad to have you here.

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:55.880 line:100%
Wasn't it plate 688?

00:18:55.960 --> 00:18:57.520 line:100%
You sure?

00:18:57.600 --> 00:18:58.840 line:100%
I'm sure.

00:19:03.400 --> 00:19:07.160 line:100%
Mr. Jin, I know someone
who'll remember it better than me.

00:19:15.240 --> 00:19:16.240 line:100%
He.

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:19.240 line:100%
-He.
-What?

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:22.920 line:100%
We are just walking in like this?

00:19:23.840 --> 00:19:25.800 line:100%
If not, are we supposed to climb in?

00:19:27.720 --> 00:19:29.320 line:100%
You've done raids here before, have you?

00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:32.320 line:100%
Even if I have, it doesn't stop you
from investigating.

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:38.960 line:100%
What I mean is,

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:41.600 line:100%
should we

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:44.600 line:100%
coordinate a bit?

00:19:47.840 --> 00:19:49.560 line:100%
You lead, I back you up.

00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:51.600 line:100%
You play one role, I play the other.

00:19:51.680 --> 00:19:52.560 line:100%
That one.

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:56.080 line:100%
This time, you're the one asking me.

00:19:58.120 --> 00:20:00.320 line:100%
What do you mean by "asking"?

00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:02.080 line:100%
We're partners.

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:03.600 line:100%
Exactly.

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:06.760 line:100%
On a case, you have to lower yourself
and act naturally.

00:20:06.840 --> 00:20:08.120 line:100%
Let's go.

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:16.120 line:100%
Welcome, boss.
We are glad to have you here.

00:20:16.720 --> 00:20:18.720 line:100%
Police. Get Ms. Xia over.

00:20:18.800 --> 00:20:19.960 line:100%
Alright.

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:33.440 line:100%
Mr. Song, I brought it.

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:36.160 line:100%
Now?

00:20:36.240 --> 00:20:38.800 line:100%
What's the point now?

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:40.280 line:100%
No, but…

00:20:40.360 --> 00:20:41.280 line:100%
I brought it.

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:45.720 line:100%
Eight million, and I ended up
with a pile of scrap! Scrap!

00:20:46.560 --> 00:20:49.360 line:100%
Li, you are dead.

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:52.320 line:100%
Officer He.

00:20:53.360 --> 00:20:55.280 line:100%
Officer He, what brings you here today?

00:20:55.360 --> 00:20:56.240 line:100%
Checking up on us?

00:20:56.320 --> 00:20:59.320 line:100%
Don't worry.
We're running things legally now.

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:00.560 line:100%
We won't break the rules.

00:21:00.640 --> 00:21:03.720 line:100%
You said that last time.
And the time before.

00:21:04.560 --> 00:21:05.920 line:100%
We have been making improvements.

00:21:08.040 --> 00:21:10.000 line:100%
Let me ask you,
which room is Song Qingsong in?

00:21:10.680 --> 00:21:13.040 line:100%
What Song Qingsong?

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:14.400 line:100%
Never heard of him.

00:21:15.680 --> 00:21:16.920 line:100%
What about Wu Shanlong?

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:18.120 line:100%
Which room is Wu Shanlong in?

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:22.280 line:100%
Officer He, I don't know who they are.

00:21:22.360 --> 00:21:24.120 line:100%
I've never heard of their names.

00:21:25.920 --> 00:21:28.080 line:100%
Ran, make a call.
Get the Public Order Unit over here.

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:35.080 line:100%
Okay. Maybe we should also call
the fire, commerce, and tax too.

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:36.760 line:100%
-We should call them all.
-Good idea. Call them all.

00:21:36.840 --> 00:21:39.280 line:100%
-Alright.
-No need.

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:42.440 line:100%
There's no need to make a fuss over this.
Everyone is tired, right?

00:21:43.840 --> 00:21:45.080 line:100%
Oh my goodness.

00:21:47.920 --> 00:21:49.240 line:100%
What are you still doing here?

00:21:49.960 --> 00:21:51.320 line:100%
Get lost!

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:57.080 line:100%
Mr. Song, getting angry
is bad for your health.

00:21:57.160 --> 00:21:58.520 line:100%
Who the heck are you?

00:21:59.760 --> 00:22:01.680 line:100%
Mr. Song, they're police.

00:22:05.360 --> 00:22:07.480 line:100%
I'm He Yuanhang from the Nanshan Branch.

00:22:08.280 --> 00:22:10.840 line:100%
I just got off work.
So I brought a colleague out to relax.

00:22:10.920 --> 00:22:13.880 line:100%
We heard you were here,
so we came by to pay a visit.

00:22:13.960 --> 00:22:16.160 line:100%
I cannot stand the cops. Get out.

00:22:16.240 --> 00:22:18.440 line:100%
Song Qingsong, we have received a report

00:22:18.520 --> 00:22:20.840 line:100%
that you solicited prostitution
at Dahuihuang.

00:22:23.520 --> 00:22:25.280 line:100%
Who is making
false accusations against me?

00:22:25.920 --> 00:22:27.920 line:100%
This briefcase contains
the payment, does it not?

00:22:32.840 --> 00:22:34.360 line:100%
The things inside the briefcase
are important documents

00:22:34.440 --> 00:22:36.480 line:100%
from the cement factory.
They're confidential.

00:22:36.560 --> 00:22:39.120 line:100%
Without a warrant,
no one is allowed to touch it.

00:22:39.200 --> 00:22:40.840 line:100%
I will call my superiors right now.

00:22:41.760 --> 00:22:42.840 line:100%
It is a misunderstanding.

00:22:43.400 --> 00:22:44.440 line:100%
It must be.

00:22:45.040 --> 00:22:46.920 line:100%
How could Mr. Song
possibly do such a thing?

00:22:47.000 --> 00:22:50.080 line:100%
Right, I almost forgot.

00:22:50.160 --> 00:22:52.040 line:100%
I have something here
for you to take a look at.

00:22:52.120 --> 00:22:53.880 line:100%
Do you know this woman?

00:22:54.480 --> 00:22:55.400 line:100%
I do not.

00:22:55.480 --> 00:22:57.080 line:100%
Let me remind you.

00:22:57.160 --> 00:22:58.920 line:100%
Muse Foot Massage. Mengmeng.

00:22:59.640 --> 00:23:01.520 line:100%
Just last week, you hit her.

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:02.800 line:100%
Nonsense.

00:23:03.320 --> 00:23:04.600 line:100%
I never hit women.

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:06.120 line:100%
Do you have any evidence?

00:23:06.720 --> 00:23:07.680 line:100%
If you have none, get lost.

00:23:10.760 --> 00:23:12.120 line:100%
Mr. Wu,

00:23:13.320 --> 00:23:14.600 line:100%
we didn't get a chance to thank you.

00:23:14.680 --> 00:23:17.720 line:100%
If you hadn't led the way,
how would we have met Mr. Song?

00:23:19.200 --> 00:23:21.000 line:100%
Mr. Song, they came on their own.

00:23:21.080 --> 00:23:23.480 line:100%
You went to the station yourself
to claim the lost items, right?

00:23:23.560 --> 00:23:26.400 line:100%
You said your brother-in-law,
Mr. Song, has treated you well,

00:23:26.480 --> 00:23:28.480 line:100%
so why are you still raking in so much?

00:23:28.560 --> 00:23:33.040 line:100%
Moutai, Zhonghua, a gold Rolex,
and gold chains.

00:23:33.120 --> 00:23:34.160 line:100%
That's over a hundred thousand.

00:23:34.240 --> 00:23:36.360 line:100%
Nonsense. You're slandering me!

00:23:36.440 --> 00:23:39.440 line:100%
Mr. Wu,
you have been very cooperative today.

00:23:39.520 --> 00:23:42.080 line:100%
You told the Criminal Department
a lot about Mr. Song,

00:23:42.760 --> 00:23:44.120 line:100%
especially about that briefcase.

00:23:44.200 --> 00:23:46.360 line:100%
We had no idea it meant so much to him.

00:23:46.440 --> 00:23:48.200 line:100%
Even when Mengmeng merely touched it,

00:23:48.280 --> 00:23:50.320 line:100%
he made sure she disappeared from Weiyang.

00:23:50.400 --> 00:23:51.720 line:100%
You're framing me! Nonsense!

00:23:52.320 --> 00:23:53.600 line:100%
Bastard!

00:23:53.680 --> 00:23:55.040 line:100%
-You bastard!
-You let go!

00:23:55.120 --> 00:23:56.160 line:100%
Qingsong!

00:23:56.240 --> 00:23:58.320 line:100%
-If he goes too far, arrest him.
-They are…

00:23:58.400 --> 00:24:00.880 line:100%
They are clearly trying to drive
a wedge between us.

00:24:04.800 --> 00:24:06.000 line:100%
Assaulting police officers is a crime.

00:24:10.720 --> 00:24:12.520 line:100%
The police are hitting me!

00:24:18.240 --> 00:24:20.440 line:100%
-Qingsong, run!
-Stop right there.

00:24:20.520 --> 00:24:22.120 line:100%
-Let go.
-Qingsong, run!

00:24:22.200 --> 00:24:23.320 line:100%
-Stop.
-Qingsong.

00:24:23.400 --> 00:24:24.320 line:100%
Vice squad!

00:24:26.040 --> 00:24:27.880 line:100%
Vice squad!

00:24:27.960 --> 00:24:31.440 line:100%
Vice squad!

00:24:32.160 --> 00:24:34.480 line:100%
-Run!
-Vice raid! Run!

00:24:39.520 --> 00:24:40.560 line:100%
Hurry! Run!

00:24:42.360 --> 00:24:43.400 line:100%
Is that him? Right?

00:24:43.480 --> 00:24:45.160 line:100%
-No. Not him.
-Is that him?

00:24:48.400 --> 00:24:49.520 line:100%
This way.

00:24:51.360 --> 00:24:52.440 line:100%
Leave now!

00:25:03.880 --> 00:25:04.880 line:100%
Mr. Jin.

00:25:04.960 --> 00:25:06.400 line:100%
The one who climbed down the pipe.

00:25:06.480 --> 00:25:08.440 line:100%
That is him! That is him!

00:25:11.000 --> 00:25:13.440 line:100%
You still recognize him
with that injury on his head?

00:25:13.520 --> 00:25:15.520 line:100%
Mr. Jin, I never forget a face.

00:25:15.600 --> 00:25:17.640 line:100%
-Bring him here. Hurry.
-Alright.

00:25:19.080 --> 00:25:20.480 line:100%
DAHUIHUANG NIGHTCLUB

00:25:24.720 --> 00:25:26.200 line:100%
-He, drive.
-Mr. Jin.

00:25:26.880 --> 00:25:27.880 line:100%
Police.

00:25:30.840 --> 00:25:32.200 line:100%
Fuck.

00:25:32.280 --> 00:25:33.760 line:100%
One after another.

00:25:34.280 --> 00:25:35.360 line:100%
What is this, Snake?

00:25:38.560 --> 00:25:39.880 line:100%
Behind us.

00:25:55.600 --> 00:25:56.680 line:100%
Son of a bitch!

00:26:14.080 --> 00:26:15.040 line:100%
Faster. Go faster.

00:26:15.120 --> 00:26:16.960 line:100%
This is just a Fukang.
He's driving a Benz.

00:26:17.040 --> 00:26:19.400 line:100%
If Song Qingsong gets away this time,
it will be hard to find him again.

00:26:41.840 --> 00:26:44.720 line:100%
Song Qingsong,
I will not let you get away.

00:26:44.800 --> 00:26:46.800 line:100%
He, don't lose your head. Be careful.

00:26:46.880 --> 00:26:49.520 line:100%
At this point, whoever eases off loses.

00:26:49.600 --> 00:26:52.080 line:100%
He's cutting me off.
Then I'll cut him off too.

00:26:52.160 --> 00:26:54.960 line:100%
If there's an accident,
we'll bring both him and the car in.

00:26:55.480 --> 00:26:56.400 line:100%
That works.

00:26:58.680 --> 00:27:00.240 line:100%
He, accelerate.

00:27:32.960 --> 00:27:35.560 line:100%
Benz, here I come.

00:27:47.400 --> 00:27:48.680 line:100%
Come on.

00:27:54.080 --> 00:27:55.240 line:100%
It won't move?

00:27:55.880 --> 00:27:57.080 line:100%
Hurry up.

00:27:57.160 --> 00:27:58.240 line:100%
-I can't move it!
-They're gone.

00:28:11.280 --> 00:28:13.240 line:100%
Song Qingsong, you scoundrel!

00:28:13.320 --> 00:28:15.520 line:100%
You wrecked my car. I'm not done with you!

00:28:20.880 --> 00:28:24.320 line:100%
<i>Wu Shanlong,</i>
<i>didn't you say it was in the safe?</i>

00:28:24.400 --> 00:28:26.840 line:100%
<i>What a coincidence</i>
<i>that the thief just happened to take it.</i>

00:28:26.920 --> 00:28:29.320 line:100%
<i>Wu Shanlong, are you playing me?</i>

00:28:29.400 --> 00:28:32.960 line:100%
Stop yelling at me.

00:28:33.040 --> 00:28:34.840 line:100%
Everyone has been yelling at me today.

00:28:35.840 --> 00:28:37.560 line:100%
I'm telling you,
even if we got the documents,

00:28:37.640 --> 00:28:38.760 line:100%
they're useless now.

00:28:38.840 --> 00:28:40.360 line:100%
<i>Useless?</i>

00:28:40.440 --> 00:28:41.960 line:100%
<i>What do you mean? Explain.</i>

00:28:42.480 --> 00:28:44.840 line:100%
Dongshan Mine was robbed.
You know that, right?

00:28:44.920 --> 00:28:46.080 line:100%
The bidding documents were inside.

00:28:46.160 --> 00:28:48.560 line:100%
Song Qingsong is furious.

00:28:48.640 --> 00:28:50.600 line:100%
He spent eight million
on a pile of worthless paper.

00:28:50.680 --> 00:28:54.120 line:100%
You want to blackmail him
with that pile of worthless paper?

00:29:01.000 --> 00:29:02.000 line:100%
The police came just now.

00:29:03.040 --> 00:29:06.800 line:100%
They seem to be onto Mengmeng.

00:29:08.600 --> 00:29:10.560 line:100%
If Song Qingsong gets arrested,

00:29:11.120 --> 00:29:12.480 line:100%
neither of us is getting out of this.

00:29:14.120 --> 00:29:15.400 line:100%
What do we do now?

00:29:16.800 --> 00:29:18.000 line:100%
<i>I know what to do.</i>

00:29:21.640 --> 00:29:22.480 line:100%
Hello?

00:29:23.920 --> 00:29:24.920 line:100%
Hello?

00:29:55.440 --> 00:30:01.320 line:100%
QINGSONG CEMENT

00:30:01.400 --> 00:30:08.400 line:20%
FAIR AND JUST, LOYAL AND TRUE

00:30:12.880 --> 00:30:13.880 line:100%
SPECIAL TASK FORCE MEMBER LIST

00:30:14.600 --> 00:30:16.560 line:100%
-Xiaohe.
-Xiaohe.

00:30:16.640 --> 00:30:18.040 line:100%
What major case is it this time?

00:30:18.120 --> 00:30:19.720 line:100%
Four teenagers went missing
in Binchuan District.

00:30:19.800 --> 00:30:20.640 line:100%
They still have not been found.

00:30:20.720 --> 00:30:22.480 line:100%
Now the municipal bureau
is forming a special task force.

00:30:22.560 --> 00:30:23.720 line:100%
Our district has to assist.

00:30:23.800 --> 00:30:24.880 line:100%
Didn't they call you to join?

00:30:26.600 --> 00:30:28.120 line:100%
Enough chatting. Meeting.

00:30:29.600 --> 00:30:30.760 line:100%
We will go up first.

00:30:41.000 --> 00:30:42.760 line:100%
Xiaohe, you're finally here.

00:30:42.840 --> 00:30:44.280 line:100%
Captain Zhao has been looking for you.

00:30:44.360 --> 00:30:45.600 line:100%
-For me?
-Go on.

00:30:47.480 --> 00:30:49.560 line:100%
APPROVED

00:30:51.080 --> 00:30:53.920 line:100%
-Captain Zhao.
-Come in.

00:30:54.000 --> 00:30:55.160 line:100%
APPROVED BY ZHAO JIE

00:30:57.280 --> 00:30:58.400 line:100%
Sit.

00:31:02.600 --> 00:31:03.720 line:100%
Xiaohe,

00:31:04.480 --> 00:31:07.480 line:100%
about Han Zi'ang's case,
I plan to assign it to you.

00:31:08.080 --> 00:31:09.120 line:100%
Han Zi'ang's case?

00:31:10.320 --> 00:31:12.280 line:100%
What about the one in Binchuan District?

00:31:14.720 --> 00:31:16.800 line:100%
What, you think
this case isn't big enough?

00:31:18.280 --> 00:31:20.680 line:100%
Of course not.
I wouldn't dare pick and choose.

00:31:20.760 --> 00:31:22.520 line:100%
Captain, don't worry.

00:31:22.600 --> 00:31:24.360 line:100%
I will make sure this case
is thoroughly investigated.

00:31:24.440 --> 00:31:27.480 line:100%
About this case, Captain Qu
wrote a report yesterday.

00:31:28.000 --> 00:31:28.880 line:100%
You can refer to it.

00:31:28.960 --> 00:31:29.880 line:100%
Okay.

00:31:30.400 --> 00:31:32.560 line:100%
From what we can tell,
it's most likely a prank.

00:31:32.640 --> 00:31:35.480 line:100%
So, the focus is on cleanup
and calming the parents.

00:31:35.560 --> 00:31:36.720 line:100%
Understood?

00:31:38.760 --> 00:31:40.880 line:100%
CAPTAIN'S OFFICE

00:31:48.600 --> 00:31:49.840 line:100%
One more thing.

00:31:50.600 --> 00:31:52.760 line:100%
Sort out your family matters
as soon as possible.

00:32:04.600 --> 00:32:06.320 line:100%
See? I told you.

00:32:06.840 --> 00:32:08.240 line:100%
By seniority,

00:32:08.320 --> 00:32:11.040 line:100%
Zhao Jie is still just a kid to me.

00:32:11.800 --> 00:32:14.720 line:100%
He Yuanhang,
you should give up on that idea.

00:32:15.640 --> 00:32:16.680 line:100%
I will not let you,

00:32:17.920 --> 00:32:20.040 line:100%
or any of you, get involved in this case.

00:32:21.120 --> 00:32:23.920 line:100%
Just treat me and Mr. Ran as helpers.

00:32:24.000 --> 00:32:26.160 line:100%
No need to feed us. We won't steal credit.

00:32:26.240 --> 00:32:27.880 line:100%
All upside.

00:32:27.960 --> 00:32:30.760 line:100%
If you keep causing trouble,
I'll transfer back to the archives

00:32:30.840 --> 00:32:32.520 line:100%
-and sit there doing nothing.
-No, no.

00:32:33.880 --> 00:32:35.760 line:100%
I'm begging you. Please.

00:32:35.840 --> 00:32:38.400 line:100%
Help Mr. Ran, okay?

00:32:38.480 --> 00:32:39.800 line:100%
There is nothing I can do to help him.

00:32:39.880 --> 00:32:42.520 line:100%
He Xiaohe, that is Mr. Ran.

00:32:42.600 --> 00:32:43.960 line:100%
He watched you grow up.

00:32:44.040 --> 00:32:45.800 line:100%
Have you forgotten how good he was to you?

00:32:45.880 --> 00:32:47.160 line:100%
I have not.

00:32:48.000 --> 00:32:49.480 line:100%
He's doing quite well now.

00:32:49.560 --> 00:32:51.560 line:100%
Stop bothering him.
It's not good for either of you.

00:32:54.400 --> 00:32:56.320 line:100%
He's just pretending he's fine.

00:32:56.960 --> 00:33:00.000 line:100%
Since I came back, I have looked into it.

00:33:00.080 --> 00:33:03.000 line:100%
I found that he's still avoiding
that case from back then.

00:33:03.600 --> 00:33:04.960 line:100%
It's his demon.

00:33:05.600 --> 00:33:07.960 line:100%
We need to help him face it.

00:33:08.040 --> 00:33:09.760 line:100%
-Face it?
-Right.

00:33:09.840 --> 00:33:12.240 line:100%
-And then?
-Then,

00:33:12.760 --> 00:33:16.200 line:100%
he stays in Weiyang
and rejoins the Criminal Department.

00:33:16.280 --> 00:33:18.120 line:100%
You're dreaming again.

00:33:18.200 --> 00:33:19.560 line:100%
He's a university lecturer now.

00:33:19.640 --> 00:33:21.840 line:100%
Can he just be transferred back
to the Criminal Department?

00:33:22.800 --> 00:33:24.640 line:100%
Besides, he's doing great in Beijing.

00:33:24.720 --> 00:33:27.000 line:100%
Why do you insist
on bringing him back to Weiyang?

00:33:27.080 --> 00:33:28.760 line:100%
That's for later.

00:33:28.840 --> 00:33:30.760 line:100%
Right now, let's talk
about the helpers thing.

00:33:30.840 --> 00:33:32.680 line:100%
I'll be honest with you.

00:33:33.200 --> 00:33:36.200 line:100%
Captain Zhao assigned this case
to me not because of you.

00:33:36.280 --> 00:33:39.000 line:100%
Everyone thinks it's a prank.
Barely even a case.

00:33:39.080 --> 00:33:40.040 line:100%
What?

00:33:41.400 --> 00:33:43.400 line:100%
What kind of logic is that?

00:33:43.920 --> 00:33:46.280 line:100%
Back when Xu Meng
and her father went missing,

00:33:46.360 --> 00:33:47.800 line:100%
everyone said it was a prank too.

00:33:47.880 --> 00:33:49.040 line:100%
Was it?

00:33:54.440 --> 00:33:55.400 line:100%
Dad,

00:33:56.960 --> 00:33:58.400 line:100%
stop dwelling on the past.

00:34:00.120 --> 00:34:01.240 line:100%
Go home.

00:34:02.000 --> 00:34:03.480 line:100%
I've got work.

00:34:05.840 --> 00:34:06.680 line:100%
Hey!

00:34:17.320 --> 00:34:24.320 line:100%
FAIR AND JUST, LOYAL AND TRUE

00:34:31.880 --> 00:34:32.720 line:100%
Master!

00:34:35.920 --> 00:34:37.560 line:100%
Master, thank you.

00:34:37.640 --> 00:34:39.400 line:100%
Master, thank you.

00:34:39.479 --> 00:34:41.600 line:100%
I really should have
listened to you yesterday

00:34:41.680 --> 00:34:42.720 line:100%
and gone straight to Yuanlongli.

00:34:42.800 --> 00:34:45.439 line:100%
Would've saved a lot of trouble.
Thank you so much.

00:34:45.519 --> 00:34:46.920 line:100%
-Thank you.
-It's nothing.

00:34:46.999 --> 00:34:48.080 line:100%
No big deal.

00:34:48.160 --> 00:34:49.200 line:100%
How's your child?

00:34:49.280 --> 00:34:51.240 line:100%
He is still unconscious.

00:34:51.320 --> 00:34:52.920 line:100%
The police say he attacked
someone with a knife.

00:34:52.999 --> 00:34:54.080 line:100%
How is that possible?

00:34:54.160 --> 00:34:56.960 line:100%
The school wants to expel him.

00:34:57.040 --> 00:35:00.200 line:100%
I really don't know what to do.

00:35:01.720 --> 00:35:03.840 line:100%
But he did attack someone.

00:35:03.920 --> 00:35:06.400 line:100%
Did anyone actually see it?

00:35:06.480 --> 00:35:08.240 line:100%
Bring that person out
and let them face me.

00:35:08.320 --> 00:35:11.520 line:100%
I want to see who it was
that knocked him unconscious.

00:35:12.240 --> 00:35:13.440 line:100%
Master,

00:35:14.520 --> 00:35:15.640 line:100%
you are experienced.

00:35:15.720 --> 00:35:17.040 line:100%
Please do a reading for me.

00:35:17.120 --> 00:35:19.920 line:100%
See whether my child
can get through this safely.

00:35:20.720 --> 00:35:22.000 line:100%
I don't do fortune-telling.

00:35:22.080 --> 00:35:22.960 line:100%
I only find people.

00:35:23.600 --> 00:35:25.440 line:100%
Then please help me find the culprit.

00:35:28.240 --> 00:35:31.520 line:100%
How about I find you an expert?
If he takes the case,

00:35:31.600 --> 00:35:33.400 line:100%
your child's situation will definitely
be thoroughly investigated.

00:35:33.480 --> 00:35:34.520 line:100%
I'll do whatever you say.

00:35:34.600 --> 00:35:36.440 line:100%
Wait here, I'll call him out.

00:35:36.960 --> 00:35:38.360 line:100%
Thank you, Master. Thank you.

00:35:41.200 --> 00:35:43.160 line:100%
He really is remarkable.

00:36:01.760 --> 00:36:04.280 line:100%
Hurry up. The mother is waiting.

00:36:05.720 --> 00:36:06.840 line:100%
Move it.

00:36:08.120 --> 00:36:09.800 line:100%
You're so careless.

00:36:15.320 --> 00:36:17.680 line:100%
Ms. Wang, I have been looking
for you. Get in the car.

00:36:19.040 --> 00:36:20.560 line:100%
Officer He, I'm waiting for someone.

00:36:20.640 --> 00:36:22.840 line:100%
Han Zi'ang's case is now under my charge.

00:36:22.920 --> 00:36:24.400 line:100%
If you want to find out the truth,
come with me.

00:36:25.560 --> 00:36:27.760 line:100%
-But…
-Hurry, get in.

00:36:28.400 --> 00:36:30.120 line:100%
-Alright.
-Kiddo.

00:36:34.680 --> 00:36:36.000 line:100%
Kiddo.

00:36:51.520 --> 00:36:55.440 line:100%
Ms. Wang, don't worry too much
about your son's case.

00:36:55.520 --> 00:36:58.320 line:100%
The victim only has minor injuries.
It's considered a light offense.

00:36:58.920 --> 00:37:00.040 line:100%
Trust us.

00:37:00.640 --> 00:37:02.040 line:100%
We'll get to the truth.

00:37:03.480 --> 00:37:07.200 line:100%
Ang is innocent.

00:37:08.200 --> 00:37:09.880 line:100%
He's so young.

00:37:09.960 --> 00:37:13.960 line:100%
If he grows up carrying that,
what will people think of him?

00:37:15.360 --> 00:37:17.760 line:100%
He's in a private school now.

00:37:18.800 --> 00:37:20.200 line:100%
Look at me.

00:37:20.800 --> 00:37:25.360 line:100%
I pulled strings and spent
a lot of money to get him in.

00:37:26.760 --> 00:37:29.280 line:100%
If he gets expelled,

00:37:30.720 --> 00:37:33.640 line:100%
our lives will be ruined.

00:37:36.880 --> 00:37:40.280 line:100%
I'll go to the school tomorrow
and speak to the principal.

00:37:41.600 --> 00:37:44.040 line:100%
Thank you. Thank you, Officer.

00:37:44.120 --> 00:37:45.400 line:100%
But I have one condition.

00:37:47.320 --> 00:37:48.440 line:100%
Go ahead.

00:37:49.680 --> 00:37:50.960 line:100%
Stop seeing that old man.

00:37:52.920 --> 00:37:54.400 line:100%
Master?

00:37:54.480 --> 00:37:57.800 line:100%
-Why?
-He's no master. He's my dad.

00:37:59.360 --> 00:38:00.760 line:100%
He's a fraud.

00:38:01.760 --> 00:38:03.240 line:20%
You've got some nerve.

00:38:04.600 --> 00:38:06.800 line:20%
You tricked Song Qingsong?

00:38:07.400 --> 00:38:11.240 line:100%
You think someone like him
is that easy to trick?

00:38:12.400 --> 00:38:13.520 line:100%
He's suspicious.

00:38:14.840 --> 00:38:16.640 line:100%
Just a few looks
and you call him a suspect?

00:38:16.720 --> 00:38:20.880 line:100%
Where is the evidence? No evidence,
and now it's backfired on you.

00:38:23.200 --> 00:38:25.560 line:100%
The traffic police called me.

00:38:25.640 --> 00:38:28.040 line:100%
They said a Mercedes driver
reported you for rear-ending him.

00:38:28.640 --> 00:38:29.840 line:100%
He wants 30,000.

00:38:30.520 --> 00:38:31.560 line:100%
How much?

00:38:32.640 --> 00:38:33.520 line:100%
Thirty thousand.

00:38:45.440 --> 00:38:46.840 line:100%
-Done?
-Don't touch it.

00:38:46.920 --> 00:38:48.000 line:100%
It's not dry yet.

00:38:52.120 --> 00:38:53.720 line:100%
I'm not letting this go
with Song Qingsong.

00:38:53.800 --> 00:38:55.080 line:100%
Keep an eye on Xiaohe.

00:38:55.160 --> 00:38:56.320 line:100%
I'm going to stake out the cement factory.

00:38:56.400 --> 00:38:57.240 line:100%
He.

00:38:58.560 --> 00:38:59.720 line:100%
I was impulsive yesterday.

00:38:59.800 --> 00:39:01.040 line:100%
-I'm afraid…
-Afraid of what?

00:39:01.120 --> 00:39:02.080 line:100%
I'm not afraid of anyone.

00:39:03.480 --> 00:39:06.160 line:100%
Dad, is that the bad guy who hit our car?

00:39:06.240 --> 00:39:08.120 line:100%
I'm going too!

00:39:08.760 --> 00:39:09.760 line:100%
Kiddo, be good.

00:39:09.840 --> 00:39:12.760 line:100%
Stay with Uncle Ran today.
I'll pick you up later.

00:39:14.240 --> 00:39:16.400 line:100%
Don't worry. I am not being impulsive.

00:39:16.480 --> 00:39:17.720 line:100%
I have to keep an eye on Song Qingsong.

00:39:17.800 --> 00:39:19.520 line:100%
-If not, he'll slip away.
-He.

00:39:20.240 --> 00:39:24.040 line:100%
If we can't get him soon,
we'll have no other leads.

00:39:24.600 --> 00:39:26.720 line:100%
I want to try that maze theory.

00:39:26.800 --> 00:39:29.160 line:100%
We've only got two days left.
Try whatever theory you've got.

00:39:29.240 --> 00:39:30.280 line:100%
-I'm heading out.
-Hey!

00:39:30.880 --> 00:39:32.320 line:100%
Be careful.

00:39:39.640 --> 00:39:42.360 line:100%
Officer Ran,
this is Luandongzi's statement.

00:39:42.440 --> 00:39:44.280 line:100%
-We need you to verify it.
-Thank you.

00:39:55.240 --> 00:39:57.280 line:100%
QUESTION: HOW DID YOU GET IN YUANLONGLI?
ANSWER: YOU'VE CAME TO THE RIGHT PERSON

00:39:58.320 --> 00:40:00.240 line:100%
There's an underground garage
at Yuanlongli?

00:40:00.320 --> 00:40:01.560 line:100%
Yes.

00:40:01.640 --> 00:40:03.400 line:100%
Luandongzi said people who pass by there

00:40:03.480 --> 00:40:05.560 line:100%
can avoid the cameras at
the security booth and building entrance.

00:40:08.280 --> 00:40:10.840 line:20%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:40:41.280 --> 00:40:42.440 line:100%
Officer Ran,

00:40:42.520 --> 00:40:46.320 line:100%
the entrance to this underground garage
was sealed a few years ago.

00:40:46.400 --> 00:40:49.720 line:100%
There's only this small access door now.
You need a key.

00:40:50.640 --> 00:40:51.800 line:100%
Where is the exit?

00:40:52.960 --> 00:40:55.360 line:100%
Outside the compound. Also needs a key.

00:40:55.960 --> 00:40:57.880 line:100%
Besides the property management,
who else has keys?

00:40:57.960 --> 00:40:59.120 line:100%
Not sure.

00:40:59.200 --> 00:41:00.840 line:100%
You'll have to ask Manager Qian.

00:41:05.200 --> 00:41:08.080 line:100%
Officer Ran, I need to get back
to the CCTV room.

00:41:08.160 --> 00:41:10.680 line:100%
I'll leave you here.
All the keys for New York Block are here.

00:41:10.760 --> 00:41:13.040 line:100%
Return them to the property office
when you're done.

00:41:13.120 --> 00:41:14.440 line:100%
-Thank you.
-You are welcome.

00:41:14.520 --> 00:41:15.360 line:100%
I'm heading off.

00:41:15.440 --> 00:41:16.560 line:100%
-Bye.
-Okay.

00:41:21.280 --> 00:41:22.200 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:41:24.480 --> 00:41:27.240 line:100%
Uncle Ran,
this underground maze is so cool.

00:41:27.320 --> 00:41:29.000 line:100%
Stay close.

00:41:29.080 --> 00:41:30.960 line:100%
There might be rats running out.

00:41:31.040 --> 00:41:32.880 line:100%
I'm not afraid of rats.

00:41:32.960 --> 00:41:36.040 line:100%
I caught one this big at my grandma's.

00:41:57.360 --> 00:41:58.520 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:41:59.240 --> 00:42:00.120 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:42:01.280 --> 00:42:04.600 line:100%
Uncle Ran. I caught a big rat!

00:42:04.680 --> 00:42:06.840 line:100%
What are you doing? Let go!

00:42:07.480 --> 00:42:08.480 line:100%
Who are you?

00:42:09.680 --> 00:42:11.720 line:100%
-Stop shining that light!
-Manager Qian?

00:42:11.800 --> 00:42:12.680 line:100%
What are you doing here?

00:42:13.320 --> 00:42:16.400 line:100%
Someone reported
that the motion lights are broken.

00:42:16.480 --> 00:42:17.600 line:100%
I came to fix them.

00:42:17.680 --> 00:42:18.680 line:20%
SAFETY FIRST

00:42:21.360 --> 00:42:23.920 line:100%
Does an electrician's work
need the property manager to handle?

00:42:24.960 --> 00:42:25.920 line:100%
Oh, come on.

00:42:26.000 --> 00:42:27.880 line:100%
Uncle Ran, don't believe him.

00:42:27.960 --> 00:42:30.240 line:100%
He looks more like a thief.

00:42:30.880 --> 00:42:32.240 line:100%
Watch your mouth.

00:42:32.320 --> 00:42:34.040 line:100%
Whose daughter are you?

00:42:34.120 --> 00:42:35.440 line:100%
Officer He's daughter.

00:42:36.800 --> 00:42:37.880 line:100%
No wonder.

00:42:37.960 --> 00:42:40.080 line:100%
Your dad and I are good friends.

00:42:40.160 --> 00:42:42.200 line:100%
You should be calling me Mr. Qian.

00:42:42.280 --> 00:42:45.280 line:100%
Save it. I'm not friends with a thief.

00:42:45.360 --> 00:42:46.400 line:100%
You!

00:42:50.640 --> 00:42:51.720 line:100%
Officer Ran,

00:42:53.040 --> 00:42:55.360 line:100%
what are you doing down here?

00:43:01.000 --> 00:43:02.520 line:100%
Stop coughing.

00:43:02.600 --> 00:43:05.080 line:100%
That penny-pincher
turned off the motion lights.

00:43:05.160 --> 00:43:07.480 line:100%
-Why?
-To save electricity.

00:43:07.560 --> 00:43:10.120 line:100%
Tell me, what is he doing
with all that cement?

00:43:10.200 --> 00:43:13.200 line:100%
-Building a grave at home?
-You two!

00:43:14.600 --> 00:43:15.560 line:100%
Did you hear that?

00:43:15.640 --> 00:43:16.720 line:100%
What was that sound?

00:43:16.800 --> 00:43:18.920 line:100%
Could it be those two missing people?

00:43:19.440 --> 00:43:20.280 line:100%
Are you serious?

00:43:22.440 --> 00:43:23.960 line:100%
You two!

00:43:25.400 --> 00:43:27.080 line:100%
-Oh my goodness!
-Who is it?

00:43:27.160 --> 00:43:29.680 line:100%
Don't scare me. I'm afraid of the dark!

00:43:35.240 --> 00:43:38.080 line:100%
You two, get out here now!

00:43:39.240 --> 00:43:40.360 line:100%
Why aren't you at work?

00:43:40.440 --> 00:43:42.880 line:100%
What are you doing down here? For what?

00:43:42.960 --> 00:43:44.400 line:100%
Didn't you tell us to…

00:43:44.480 --> 00:43:45.480 line:100%
I… Tell…

00:43:45.560 --> 00:43:47.040 line:100%
Tell what?

00:43:47.120 --> 00:43:48.520 line:100%
Get back to work!

00:43:52.880 --> 00:43:54.040 line:100%
Wait.

00:43:57.360 --> 00:43:58.280 line:100%
You dropped something.

00:44:09.320 --> 00:44:11.280 line:100%
Officer Ran, I still have things
to do at the property office.

00:44:11.960 --> 00:44:13.480 line:100%
I'll be heading up now too.

00:44:14.360 --> 00:44:15.400 line:100%
Hold on.

00:44:19.160 --> 00:44:22.080 line:100%
Besides the property management,
who else has the key to the garage?

00:44:25.120 --> 00:44:27.600 line:100%
When Yuanlongli was first built,

00:44:28.120 --> 00:44:29.120 line:100%
there weren't many cars.

00:44:29.200 --> 00:44:30.880 line:100%
The vehicle entrance was sealed off.

00:44:30.960 --> 00:44:33.520 line:100%
At that time,
only the property management had the key.

00:44:33.600 --> 00:44:36.680 line:100%
But then, later on,
the Pattia Club opened.

00:44:36.760 --> 00:44:38.480 line:100%
They were afraid of resident complaints,

00:44:38.560 --> 00:44:41.320 line:100%
so they had their guests
and staff use the garage.

00:44:41.400 --> 00:44:43.400 line:100%
The keys just couldn't be tracked anymore.

00:44:44.320 --> 00:44:45.200 line:100%
Officer Ran,

00:44:45.720 --> 00:44:49.640 line:100%
-I… I'll be going…
-Just go. Mr. Penny-pincher.

00:44:52.520 --> 00:44:54.160 line:100%
You really take after your dad.

00:45:33.240 --> 00:45:36.680 line:20%
SAFETY FIRST